WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.1 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Your legal and regulatory map

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Know every legal duty you carry, who oversees it and who owns it.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Map duties from your form, activities, countries and funders.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Give every duty an owner and a deadline.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Mark what a qualified local adviser has confirmed.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside: charity report to the regulator, company filings, payroll, product safety, DBS checks for schools, insurance each April.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a legal map and a list of open questions.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
